# Keep the build context small and — more importantly — keep secrets and host artefacts out of image layers.
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
.turbo
**/.turbo

# Secrets: never bake environment files into an image. Configuration is injected at runtime.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Host-built artefacts. They are rebuilt inside the image; copying them would mix in the
# wrong platform's binaries (e.g. the Windows Prisma query engine, native bcrypt).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/database/src/generated

# Not needed to build or run
docs
infrastructure/nginx
infrastructure/observability
infrastructure/scripts
*.log
variable-table-type.txt
schema-documentation.txt
